third_party/media-signing-framework/. That code is Copyright (c) 2025 ONVIF and
MIT licensed. See third_party/media-signing-framework/LICENSE. It is not
relicensed as Nanexus Apache-2.0 code. This notice does not grant ONVIF
certification, endorsement, or trademark permission. The upstream snapshot is
tag r25.12.6, commit cf7785ab993c18d921094e8e505c2c34a1350f28, from
https://github.com/onvif/media-signing-framework. The vendored lib/src/oms_tlv.c
includes one local modification: decode_tlv_header rejects UNDEFINED_TAG before
decoder dispatch. The root meson.build does not probe libcheck and does not
build the upstream tests or examples. File hashes and the Meson adjustment are
recorded in third_party/media-signing-framework/PROVENANCE.

